Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:32.21,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}隠してもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:32.21,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}藏着也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.59,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFDDA4&}アピってもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:33.59,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&\}表现出来也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.23,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}フィクションのラブコメは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:35.23,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}书本里的恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:36.31,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}嘘ばかり…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:36.31,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}那都是假的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.67,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}焦ったらバレ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.67,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}一着急就会露馅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.13,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}デレちゃったら負け？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.13,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}害羞了就输了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:40.95,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}下心隠すのも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:40.95,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}七七八八小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:41.89,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}必死です!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:41.89,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}非得藏住不可！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:43.26,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}触ってもいい？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:43.26,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}可以摸你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:44.64,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}ドキッてしてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:44.64,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}有没有心动？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.27,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}子ども扱いしても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.27,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}把我成当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.35,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}変わんない{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.35,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}我也不会收敛哦{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:48.85,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}分かってないな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:48.85,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}你还是不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:50.23,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}ズバッといきな！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:50.23,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}那我就直说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.90,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}親友の特権も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.90,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}我或许也有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.02,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}あるかも...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.02,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}身为亲友的特权……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.69,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作戦も駆け引きも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.69,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作战也好、计谋也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:57.90,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}君には届かない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:57.90,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}对你统统没用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:02:01.19,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}どうして好きにさせたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:02:01.19,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我为什么会喜欢你？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:06.51,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}ラブコメは両思いじゃなきゃダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:06.51,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}恋爱喜剧就一定得是两情相悦！
